[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Versioned compact-model requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SCH-COMPACT-ANGELOV-GAN
TITLE: angelov-gan compact-model binding
STATEMENT: >>>
The catalog shall give angelov-gan an exact model identity and version, ordered electrical and optional thermal terminals, typed parameters, and advertised analysis capabilities. Reject unavailable or incompatible providers explicitly.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Catalog target. Verify descriptor-to-symbol pin order and parameter binding. Compare independent DC bias points and qualify AC derivatives, transient charge, thermal behavior or noise individually when advertised.
<<<

